WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.797
This query groups order rows by product.

00:00:02.797 --> 00:00:07.072
The output grain changes from one order row to one product.

00:00:07.072 --> 00:00:11.487
That grain change is important in Postgres and in Spark.

00:00:11.487 --> 00:00:19.162
In Spark, group by can also create a shuffle because rows with the same product may need to be brought together across

00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:19.848
workers.
